    "body": "Because nushell often has breaking changes, the latest version of starship only supports nushell 0.61 or higher, and until the next release of starship, it won't work out-of-the-box in nushell 0.70 or higher either (#4507). \r\nPlease try upgrading nushell to a supported version.",
